{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達創始人黃仁勳突然辭去公司行政總裁職務後，圍繞其回歸的呼聲正在科技行業和公司內部逐漸升温。特斯拉與SpaceX創始人埃隆·馬斯克也公開加入支持行列，表示一份要求黃仁勳重新執掌英偉達的請願書正在籌備，而他本人將籤署支持。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586350.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.980677+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:38:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"52eb1517a0037354ca79e10b4a1990566b000214fd3450a8d0d8fe73a7178481","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}